          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "رکھوانا (rakhvānā) is the causative of rakhnā, \"to put, to keep\", which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit rakṣati, \"guards\" (CDIAL 10547): to have someone put a thing away."
